# Many Turns Parent Site (.cursorrules)

## Session start (every fresh thread)
1. Read `PROJECT_STATE.md` then `NEXT.md` before proposing or building.
2. Treat **LOCKED PRODUCT DIRECTION** + **DECISION LOG** in `PROJECT_STATE.md` as law. Do not re-open them for “review” or taste.
3. Execute the top matching open `NEXT.md` item. Do not invent a new strategy pass.
4. One slice only. Commit / push only if Sam asks.

## Session end (every slice / stage — mandatory)
Before you stop: run `NEXT.md` quality gates → update `PROJECT_STATE.md` facts (+ decision log if a new lock) → close finished items in `NEXT.md` → bump Last updated.  
Do **not** redesign the MD from scratch each time — only patch what changed.  
Rewrite `.cursorrules` only if the session contract or locked product shape drifted (rare).

## Anti-review theatre (stop wasting Sam)
- Do **not** ask Sam to re-confirm locked journey-first home, door hero standard, TurnCrossroads, `/built` catalogue-story model, protected winding M, or “no brand grid on `/`”.
- Do **not** re-assess Stage 1 or re-pitch consulting naming unless the open NEXT item is that decision and Sam asked.
- Do **not** propose redesigns of live child sites (kavsulting.com / asia-insights.com / Trivia Deck app).
- Prefer: ship the slice → run quality gates in `NEXT.md` → update canon in place → stop.
- Ask Sam only for: true blockers, R1/R2/R5/R6/R7/R8 owner=Sam items, or scope expansion beyond NEXT.

## Slice contract (default)
Authorised: the open NEXT item being executed.  
Do not touch: locked direction, other ventures’ live codebases, Stage 5 without approval.  
Done when: NEXT “QUALITY GATES” pass + PROJECT_STATE/NEXT updated.  
Commit only if asked.

## Stack
- Next.js App Router + TypeScript (read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` — this Next differs from training data; see `AGENTS.md`)
- Tailwind CSS v4 + CSS variables
- `lucide-react`, `framer-motion`
- Parent type: UI via existing layout fonts; consulting door uses Castoro Titling → Cinzel + Space Mono (pending Sam wordmark lock)

## Parent visual system (production target)
- Palette: Midnight `#0B1018` · Deep blue `#174D83` · Steel `#8DCFFF` · Ivory `#F2F2EF`
- Tagline: **Different paths. One journey.**
- Philosophy: **Make the complex simple. Not the simple complex.**
- Master mark: winding-path **M** only (`public/brand/m-mark.svg` / brand board). Not interlocking loops. Not a new mark.
- Home = journey spine + solution. Not a brand portfolio strip. Not a solutions carousel.

## Product shape (locked)
- `/` journey turns → Continue this turn → child doors
- `/advisory` `/asia-insights` `/trivia-deck` = live-child **hero** + left/right **TurnCrossroads**
- `/built` = catalogue **story** on Many Turns; full catalogue UI stays on Kavsulting
- Child brands keep market-fit identities; parent endorsement only

## Canon
- `PROJECT_STATE.md` — intent, facts, locks, research findings, decision log
- `NEXT.md` — open queue, quality gates, research R1–R8
- `docs/brand/` — strategy brief, architecture, Stage 1, protected assets

Ignore obsolete “linen / terracotta / four pillars on home / interlocking loops” aesthetics if they appear in old pack notes — superseded by PROJECT_STATE.
